---
---

<section class="section-glass" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-glass-inner lg-card reveal">

      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="section-badge mono-font">01 / about_me</p>
        <h2 class="section-title pixel-font">quien_soy</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-grid">
        <!-- imagen -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="about-img-frame">
            <div class="about-corner tl"></div>
            <div class="about-corner tr"></div>
            <div class="about-corner bl"></div>
            <div class="about-corner br"></div>
            <div class="about-img-inner lg-card">
              <img src="/perfil_2.png" alt="Xplix coding" />
              <div class="about-img-overlay"></div>
              <div class="about-img-label lg mono-font">coding_mode.exe — activo</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- texto -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <p class="about-text">
            Hola, soy <strong>Xplix</strong> — desarrollador de mods para Minecraft con Fabric
            y fan del pixel art. Paso las noches frente al monitor creando experiencias jugables
            y muy divertidas.
          </p>
          <p class="about-text">
            Mi especialidad son los <strong>minijuegos</strong>: desde buscaminas competitivo
            hasta juegos de memoria con personalidad propia. Cada mod que creo busca algo distinto:
            adrenalina, risa, o un buen reto.
          </p>

          <div class="skills-grid">
            <div class="skill-card lg-card reveal">
              <p class="skill-name mono-font">Fabric API</p>
              <p class="skill-sub">Mod development</p>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-card lg-card reveal">
              <p class="skill-name mono-font">Minigame Design</p>
              <p class="skill-sub">Game mechanics</p>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-card lg-card reveal">
              <p class="skill-name mono-font">Java</p>
              <p class="skill-sub">Primary language</p>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-card lg-card reveal">
              <p class="skill-name mono-font">Pixel Art</p>
              <p class="skill-sub">Aesthetic enjoyer</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="about-badges">
            <span class="about-badge lg mono-font">squid_craft_fan</span>
            <span class="about-badge lg mono-font">lebiu_studio</span>
            <span class="about-badge lg mono-font">eufonia_inspired</span>
            <span class="about-badge lg mono-font">open_to_collabs</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-glass {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .section-glass-inner {
    padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 360px 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* image frame */
  .about-img-frame { position: relative; }

  .about-img-inner {
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.18), 0 0 50px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15);
  }
  .about-img-inner img {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
    display: block;
  }
  .about-img-overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      0deg, transparent, transparent 3px,
      rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.04) 3px, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.04) 4px
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .about-img-label {
    position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--green);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--green);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }
  .about-img-label::before {
    content: '●';
    color: var(--green);
    animation: blink 1.5s step-end infinite;
  }

  /* corners */
  .about-corner {
    position: absolute; width: 16px; height: 16px;
    border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.8); border-style: solid;
  }
  .tl { top: -8px; left: -8px; border-width: 2px 0 0 2px; }
  .tr { top: -8px; right: -8px; border-width: 2px 2px 0 0; }
  .bl { bottom: -8px; left: -8px; border-width: 0 0 2px 2px; }
  .br { bottom: -8px; right: -8px; border-width: 0 2px 2px 0; }

  /* text */
  .about-text {
    color: rgba(224, 242, 254, 0.75);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .about-text strong { color: var(--cyan2); }

  /* skills */
  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
  .skill-card {
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.5);
    transition: all 0.2s;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .skill-card:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--cyan2);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .skill-name { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .skill-sub  { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); }

  /* badges */
  .about-badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .about-badge {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    color: var(--cyan2);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    .section-glass-inner { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .skills-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
